{
 "title": "知识图样段：能飞多久",
 "title_en": "Knowledge-map sample",
 "audio": "配音.wav",
 "duration": 47.54,
 "segments": [
  {
   "t0": 0.3,
   "t1": 7.59,
   "zh": "黑科技三，重头戏：它到底能飞多久？官方只给了两个数：十个喷口，六百升压缩空气。",
   "en": "Trick three, the main event: how long can it fly? Tesla gave two numbers: ten jets, 600 liters of compressed air."
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.71,
   "t1": 15.72,
   "zh": "六百升，就是三个浴缸。压到三百个大气压，大约装两百公斤空气；压到七百，也就三百多公斤。",
   "en": "600 liters is three bathtubs. At 300 atmospheres that's about 200 kg of air; at 700, just over 300."
  },
  {
   "t0": 15.84,
   "t1": 22.31,
   "zh": "冷空气喷出去，每秒最多六七百米。推力八万牛，除一下：每秒要喷掉一百三十公斤。",
   "en": "Cold air leaves at 600 to 700 meters per second at most. 80 kN divided by that: 130 kg every second."
  },
  {
   "t0": 22.43,
   "t1": 27.98,
   "zh": "两百公斤，每秒一百三，一秒半见底。而且压力一掉，推力跟着掉。",
   "en": "200 kg at 130 per second: empty in a second and a half. And as pressure drops, so does thrust."
  },
  {
   "t0": 28.1,
   "t1": 34.12,
   "zh": "只悬停呢？两吨的车要两万牛，每秒三十多公斤：五到十秒，就得落地。",
   "en": "Just hovering? Two tons needs 20 kN, over 30 kg a second: down again in five to ten seconds."
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.24,
   "t1": 41.0,
   "zh": "还有隐藏减益：气体一膨胀就降温，罐子越喷越冷，压力掉得更快，喷口还会结霜。",
   "en": "Hidden penalty: expanding gas cools, the tank gets colder, pressure falls faster, and nozzles frost."
  },
  {
   "t0": 41.12,
   "t1": 45.92,
   "zh": "结论：这不是飞，是用两百公斤空气，换来的一次很贵的跳。",
   "en": "Verdict: it doesn't fly. It trades 200 kg of air for one very expensive jump."
  }
 ],
